      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have designated Bernard J. Ruggieri, Assistant to the Mayor, to be the City's Legislative Representative in Albany. During the course of the legislative session, Mr. Ruggieri will refer pending bills to appropriate City Departments and agencies for their detailed analysis and recommendations in accordance with the following standard procedure.",
